CancelWithTheHoldersKeyTest
├── when the holder cancels with their key
│   └── it should cancel the attempt, keep the counter and refuse every approval signed under the old setup
├── when the attempt ended first
│   └── it should revert
├── when the handover ran first
│   └── it should revert
└── when the accounts own path reverts
    └── it should still let a satisfying set cancel without touching the account
